DESCRIBE SCHEMA
DESCRIBE FULL SCHEMA
DESCRIBE KEYSPACES
DESCRIBE KEYSPACE
DESCRIBE KEYSPACE ks
DESCRIBE ONLY KEYSPACE ks
DESCRIBE TABLES
