DESCRIBE TYPES
DESCRIBE TYPE ks.ty
DESCRIBE FUNCTIONS
DESCRIBE FUNCTION ks.f
DESCRIBE AGGREGATES
DESCRIBE AGGREGATE agg
DESCRIBE t
DESCRIBE ks.t
